<title>USA: Greg Manning sees Q4 revs beating yr-ago.</title>
<headline>Greg Manning sees Q4 revs beating yr-ago.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CALDWELL, N.J. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greg Manning Auctions Inc said Thursday its fourth quarter revenues should top $12 million, led by strong sales at its Pacific '97 international stamp auction ended June 8.</p>
<p>The company said sales will beat fourth quarter 1996 sales of more than $10 million.</p>
<p>The company said it recorded more than $10 million in sales during the week of the Pacific auction, which ran from May 29 to June 8.</p>
</text>
